# UI screenshot hygiene

`.ui-shots/` (gitignored) holds UI verification tooling. Keep it clean:

- **Delete screenshots (`*.png`) right after analyzing them.** They are
  transient artifacts, not deliverables. Never let them accumulate.
- Keep only the reusable verification scripts: `capture-brain.mjs`,
  `check-hud-layout.mjs`, `composite-hud.mjs`. One-off probe/capture scripts
  should also be deleted once their purpose is served.
